# Editor / build artifacts
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Frontend
node_modules/
client-ui/dist/
client-ui/.vite/

# Local-only config and secrets
# Never commit secrets — use `dotnet user-secrets` or env vars.
# `appsettings.Development.json` IS tracked (shared dev config like log levels);
# put per-developer overrides in `appsettings.Local.json` which is NOT tracked.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
# `.env` at repo root holds compose secrets; `.env.example` is the tracked template.
.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/secrets.json

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Logs
*.log
